Génn bind: 1.23, taxaw.
Génn bind: (['1.23'] mbind), taxaw.
Génn bind: (['1,23'] lim mbind lim), taxaw. # 1,23 no longer valid
Génn bind: (['1,23'] lim mbind lim mbind), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['1.23'] lim, taxaw.
Génn bind: ['1.23'] raw number, taxaw.
Génn bind: ['1.23'] raw number mbind, taxaw.
Génn bind: ['1.23'] raw number mbind lim, taxaw.
>> x := (3.5 × 1000000 + 1.5).
Génn bind: x, taxaw.
>> x := (3.5 × 100000 + 0.0001 ).
Génn bind: x, taxaw.
>> x := (3.5 + 1000).
Génn bind: x, taxaw.
x := x mbind.
Génn bind: x, taxaw.
>> y := x lim.
Génn bind: y, taxaw.